data/zipf_en.json is derived from the English "large" wordlist of wordfreq by Robyn Speer
(https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq), whose data is licensed CC-BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). That file is distributed under the same licence.

data/arms.json holds the one router arm this build ships. Its `trained_license` names the licence tiers of the
query collections it was trained on; `all` includes non-commercial and unlicensed sources.
`trained_lanes` lists those collections; the weights contain no text from them.

